@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - 003 Two Groups and the Teacher in One Browser

actor "Tab A" as TabA
actor "Tab B" as TabB
actor "Teacher tab" as TeacherTab
participant "Cookie jar\n(shared by all tabs)" as Jar
participant "Join Route" as JoinAPI
participant "Student Activity Page" as Page
participant "Submission / Events Routes" as API
participant "Session Module" as Session
participant "Round Store (Lua)" as Redis

== Join (each tab gets its own seat) ==
TabA -> JoinAPI : POST /api/activities/{id}/join (teamA)
JoinAPI -> Session : createSeatId() → seatA\npruneSeatCookies(request)
JoinAPI --> TabA : 200 { groupId: teamA, seatId: seatA }\nSet-Cookie qa_seat_seatA (HttpOnly)
TabA -> Jar : store qa_seat_seatA
TabA -> Page : GET /student/activity?seat=seatA
Page -> Session : getStudentServerSession(seatA)
Session --> Page : teamA claims
TabB -> JoinAPI : POST join (teamB)
JoinAPI --> TabB : 200 { seatId: seatB }\nSet-Cookie qa_seat_seatB
TabB -> Jar : store qa_seat_seatB (qa_seat_seatA untouched)

== Live updates ==
TabA -> API : EventSource /events?seat=seatA\n(Cookie: qa_teacher, qa_seat_seatA, qa_seat_seatB)
API -> Session : getRequestSession(request)
Session -> Session : seat = seatA → verify qa_seat_seatA\n(role student, claims.seatId == seatA)
Session --> API : teamA
API --> TabA : snapshot / events projected for teamA only

== Submit (the reported bug scenario) ==
TabA -> API : POST submissions\nx-quickanswer-seat: seatA
API -> Session : getRequestSession → teamA
API -> Redis : submit(teamA, answers)
Redis --> API : acceptedOrder 1
API --> TabA : 201 teamA
TabB -> API : POST submissions\nx-quickanswer-seat: seatB
API -> Session : getRequestSession → teamB
API -> Redis : submit(teamB, answers)
Redis --> API : acceptedOrder 2
API --> TabB : 201 teamB

== Teacher in the same browser ==
TeacherTab -> API : POST rounds/{roundId}/close (no seat)
API -> Session : getRequestSession → qa_teacher only
Session --> API : teacher claims
API --> TeacherTab : 200 closed, winner teamA

== Rejected ==
TabA -> API : POST rounds/open with seat header
API -> Session : getRequestSession → student claims
API --> TabA : 403 (teacher only)
note over API
	Copied URL in another browser (no cookie) → 401
	Malformed or unknown seat → 401, never the teacher cookie
	Seat of activity X used on activity Y → 403
end note
@enduml
